Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":5564,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":438014,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":909811,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":220796,"Name":"kerrij","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220796.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1257286410,"LastPoster":{"Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":23,"Preview":{"Id":1334695,"PostDate":1289336073,"PostContent":"Definitely - I've already sent it a bunch!\u00a0 Chelito if you PM me with your email address I can s...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leahsmith21@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1276048572,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228989.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lsmith211","Id":228989,"Name":"lsmith211","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6cc26453d58ac5619b7ddaa4db6ace46","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]missy&amp;amp;eric2011[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Wow...that&#039;s a tough decision...both places really look gorgous!  Do you have to let Beverly know what your choice is before you get there then so they can reserve it?  I would really like to SEE both places in person as opposed to choosing from a picture...but then again, we chose the resort from just a picture, and that&#039;s a much bigger deal I suppose than the restraunt!  [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif[\/img] \n \n What are you ladies doing about a cake?  Are you bringing a desired design?  Do they even allow you to do that?[img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/\/huh.gif[\/img] \n \n We sent payment to Beverly...she has not charged us yet...which seems to be the norm, but she sent confirmation to our TA that she got the info...So we will keep our fingers crossed![\/quote] \n \n Ya that&#039;s completely normal. It took her a few weeks to put through our payment... not to mention us calling her and telling her to TAKE OUR MONEY! Haha. \n This is the first time someone has taken so long to take a deposit, it&#039;s strange...","Attachments":[],"Id":1321219,"PostDate":1288038174,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>missy&eric2011<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Wow...that's a tough decision...both places really look gorgous!\u00a0 Do you have to let Beverly know what your choice is before you get there then so they can reserve it?\u00a0 I would really like to SEE both places in person as opposed to choosing from a picture...but then again, we chose the resort from just a picture, and that's a much bigger deal I suppose than the restraunt!\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" height=\"16\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"16\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> What are you ladies doing about a cake?\u00a0 Are you bringing a desired design?\u00a0 Do they even allow you to do that?<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"bbcode_smiley\" height=\"\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/\/huh.gif\" width=\"\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We sent payment to Beverly...she has not charged us yet...which seems to be the norm, but she sent confirmation to our TA that she got the info...So we will keep our fingers crossed!\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Ya that's completely normal. It took her a few weeks to put through our payment... not to mention us calling her and telling her to TAKE OUR MONEY! Haha.<\/p> <p> This is the first time someone has taken so long to take a deposit, it's strange...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Married my best friend 04\/28\/11 at the Gran Bahia Principe Runaway Bay<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"trista.lundquist@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1273793347,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228171.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tris","Id":228171,"Name":"tris","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"18db83f513944d6edcaf0ee552fe0ff7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Yes, I actually asked the assistant wedding planner that and she confirmed that you can only have the garden grill or italian resturant for a semi private reception.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1321615,"PostDate":1288061167,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Yes, I actually asked the assistant wedding planner that and she confirmed that you can only have the garden grill or italian resturant for a semi private reception.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarahmconnors@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1286688453,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233060.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Espejo2be","Id":233060,"Name":"Espejo2be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"16cb1e2bf8b435d83653908cb38ade08","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I also asked if they could make a wedding cake that we picked out and she said they would do their best to match the picture that I have. I&#039;m pretty sure they want the picture before hand though.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1321616,"PostDate":1288061242,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I also asked if they could make a wedding cake that we picked out and she said they would do their best to match the picture that I have. I'm pretty sure they want the picture before hand though.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarahmconnors@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1286688453,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233060.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Espejo2be","Id":233060,"Name":"Espejo2be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2b50c6ae6816681be4f23513e4daec8c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey girl, I had a few questions to ask the assistant wedding planner to help me make a few decisions on things, just figured i&#039;d post it in case some of you had the same questions, i know how hard it is to get ahold of Beverly...\n \n &lt;font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;When do I have to make a decision on what package I would like to have? &lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At least 3 months prior to wedding date&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;How much of a deposit do you need and when?&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;25% of wedding package&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;Are the Garden Grill and the Italian resturants the only two that can have a semi private reception? &lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Yes&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;Do you have any pictures of the locations that you can have a semi private reception&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;?Please see attached&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;Are kids incld in the max amount of people for each package? or is the max just for adults?&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Yes&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;Do you have any linens for ceremony or reception? white? colored? are they incld in package price?&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font color=\"#40005f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We offer white linen for both the ceremony and reception.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;Can we bring our own colored linens if you don&#039;t have any&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font color=\"#40005f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;?Yes you may&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt; are the tables long rectangle? square? round? &lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Square tables are joined to accommodate the number of guests&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt; and what are their measurements? &lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We will get back to you on this&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;What is incld in the ceremony decorations?&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font color=\"#a1009f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;White fabric draping the gazebo and flowers from the garden. If flowers are not available we will use tulle to match your color scheme&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;Can we have a catholic priest for our ceremony? does it cost extra? &lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note that the catholic priest does not perform weddings outside the church&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;Can we bring a program that we would like the ceremony to go by, including reading done by family members?&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt; This is possible&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;Do the steel drum band play their own music or can you ask them to play certain songs? &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may forward to us your selections.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;If we provided a picture of the wedding cake that we would like, is it possible to get something made close to it?&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We would do our best to match it&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt; Do we have to bring our own knife and server?&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font color=\"#a1009f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;Can we rent the gazebo and sound system for the night of our wedding, August 6th, 2011&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;?this is possible at a cost of US500 for 2 hours-8:45pm-10:45pm&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;I heard you can have tiki torches lighting the beach around the gazebo for the dance, is this true? if so, how much does it cost?&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This can be made available at a cost of uS35 each&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;\n &lt;font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;Is there anywhere on or close by the resort to continue the party after our dance is over?&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The disco will be open until 3pm&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1321618,"PostDate":1288061420,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey girl, I had a few questions to ask the assistant wedding planner to help me make a few decisions on things, just figured i'd post it in case some of you had the same questions, i know how hard it is to get ahold of Beverly...<br \/> <br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">When do I have to make a decision on what package I would like to have? <\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>At least 3 months prior to wedding date<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">How much of a deposit do you need and when?<\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>25% of wedding package<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">Are the Garden Grill and the Italian resturants the only two that can have a semi private reception? <\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>Yes<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">Do you have any pictures of the locations that you can have a semi private reception<\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>?Please see attached<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">Are kids incld in the max amount of people for each package? or is the max just for adults?<\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong> Yes<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">Do you have any linens for ceremony or reception? white? colored? are they incld in package price?<\/font><font color=\"#40005f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong> <\/strong><\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>We offer white linen for both the ceremony and reception.<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">Can we bring our own colored linens if you don't have any<\/font><font color=\"#40005f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>?Yes you may<\/strong><\/font><font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"> are the tables long rectangle? square? round? <\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>Square tables are joined to accommodate the number of guests<\/strong><\/font><font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"> and what are their measurements? <\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>We will get back to you on this<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">What is incld in the ceremony decorations?<\/font><font color=\"#a1009f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong> <\/strong><\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>White fabric draping the gazebo and flowers from the garden. If flowers are not available we will use tulle to match your color scheme<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">Can we have a catholic priest for our ceremony? does it cost extra? <\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>Please note that the catholic priest does not perform weddings outside the church<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">Can we bring a program that we would like the ceremony to go by, including reading done by family members?<\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong> This is possible<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">Do the steel drum band play their own music or can you ask them to play certain songs? \u00a0<\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>You may forward to us your selections.<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">If we provided a picture of the wedding cake that we would like, is it possible to get something made close to it?<\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>We would do our best to match it<\/strong><\/font><font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"> Do we have to bring our own knife and server?<\/font><font color=\"#a1009f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>No<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">Can we rent the gazebo and sound system for the night of our wedding, August 6th, 2011<\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>?this is possible at a cost of US500 for 2 hours-8:45pm-10:45pm<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">I heard you can have tiki torches lighting the beach around the gazebo for the dance, is this true? if so, how much does it cost?<\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>This can be made available at a cost of uS35 each<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">Is there anywhere on or close by the resort to continue the party after our dance is over?<\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>The disco will be open until 3pm<\/strong><\/font><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarahmconnors@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1286688453,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233060.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Espejo2be","Id":233060,"Name":"Espejo2be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d33f8df728a629f4ebd594700a36bb56","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello Ladies :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I just stumbled across this site last night while i was stressing about my wedding. You guys have completely saved my sanity! I stayed up till 3:30 in the morning reading this thread and you&#039;ve answered sooo many questions of mine- as well as made me think of so many other things i wouldn&#039;t have thought of. I&#039;m getting married at GBP on April 22,2011. From the sounds of it there will be several of you there around the same time :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m so glad i now have a clear idea of how the day will go- because i had absolutely no idea how it would be set up before last night. We booked our trip back in the beginning of August, and our groups rsvp&#039;s all need to be in by Nov.1.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m so much more excited for our trip now that i&#039;ve heard such awesome reviews and seen such beautiful pictures!!!! I haven&#039;t spoken to Beverly at all yet, all my emails seem to be replied by Chandlyn. So far she&#039;s been good at getting back to us in a decent time.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Anyways, i just wanted to say thanks for giving me the questions i should be asking her and thanks for giving me some peace of mind so that maybe i can sleep tonight &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/\/wink.gif\" width=\"\" height=\"\" class=\"bbcode_smiley\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; .....my big worry now is if anyone else has the same date as me. I want the gazebo that night! hahaha&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1321723,"PostDate":1288081544,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello Ladies <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I just stumbled across this site last night while i was stressing about my wedding. You guys have completely saved my sanity! I stayed up till 3:30 in the morning reading this thread and you've answered sooo many questions of mine- as well as made me think of so many other things i wouldn't have thought of. I'm getting married at GBP on April 22,2011. From the sounds of it there will be several of you there around the same time <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> I'm so glad i now have a clear idea of how the day will go- because i had absolutely no idea how it would be set up before last night. We booked our trip back in the beginning of August, and our groups rsvp's all need to be in by Nov.1.\u00a0 I'm so much more excited for our trip now that i've heard such awesome reviews and seen such beautiful pictures!!!! I haven't spoken to Beverly at all yet, all my emails seem to be replied by Chandlyn. So far she's been good at getting back to us in a decent time.<\/p> <p> Anyways, i just wanted to say thanks for giving me the questions i should be asking her and thanks for giving me some peace of mind so that maybe i can sleep tonight <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/\/wink.gif\" width=\"\" height=\"\" class=\"bbcode_smiley\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> .....my big worry now is if anyone else has the same date as me. I want the gazebo that night! hahaha<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"c_bass47@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1288080622,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233494.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cassierose","Id":233494,"Name":"Cassierose","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bf14ff8da82c4ffd084354512b81c017","RawContent":"SOOO helpful! I think from the pictures too that the rectabgular tables that there are 4 on each side..so really tables of 8. \n \n Now to just get a sample menu for both...do any of you lovely ladies have it? [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Espejo2be[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hey girl, I had a few questions to ask the assistant wedding planner to help me make a few decisions on things, just figured i&#039;d post it in case some of you had the same questions, i know how hard it is to get ahold of Beverly...\n \n [font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#2f2f2f]When do I have to make a decision on what package I would like to have? [\/color][\/size][\/font][font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#800080][b]At least 3 months prior to wedding date[\/b][\/color][\/size][\/font]\n [font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#2f2f2f]How much of a deposit do you need and when?[\/color][\/size][\/font][font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#800080][b]25% of wedding package[\/b][\/color][\/size][\/font]\n [font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#2f2f2f]Are the Garden Grill and the Italian resturants the only two that can have a semi private reception? [\/color][\/size][\/font][font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#800080][b]Yes[\/b][\/color][\/size][\/font]\n [font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#2f2f2f]Do you have any pictures of the locations that you can have a semi private reception[\/color][\/size][\/font][font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#800080][b]?Please see attached[\/b][\/color][\/size][\/font]\n [font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#2f2f2f]Are kids incld in the max amount of people for each package? or is the max just for adults?[\/color][\/size][\/font][font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#800080][b] Yes[\/b][\/color][\/size][\/font]\n [font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#2f2f2f]Do you have any linens for ceremony or reception? white? colored? are they incld in package price?[\/color][\/size][\/font][font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#40005f][b] [\/b][\/color][\/size][\/font][font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#800080][b]We offer white linen for both the ceremony and reception.[\/b][\/color][\/size][\/font]\n [font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#2f2f2f]Can we bring our own colored linens if you don&#039;t have any[\/color][\/size][\/font][font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#40005f][b]?Yes you may[\/b][\/color][\/size][\/font][font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#2f2f2f] are the tables long rectangle? square? round? [\/color][\/size][\/font][font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#800080][b]Square tables are joined to accommodate the number of guests[\/b][\/color][\/size][\/font][font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#2f2f2f] and what are their measurements? [\/color][\/size][\/font][font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#800080][b]We will get back to you on this[\/b][\/color][\/size][\/font]\n [font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#2f2f2f]What is incld in the ceremony decorations?[\/color][\/size][\/font][font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#a1009f][b] [\/b][\/color][\/size][\/font][font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#800080][b]White fabric draping the gazebo and flowers from the garden. If flowers are not available we will use tulle to match your color scheme[\/b][\/color][\/size][\/font]\n [font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#2f2f2f]Can we have a catholic priest for our ceremony? does it cost extra? [\/color][\/size][\/font][font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#800080][b]Please note that the catholic priest does not perform weddings outside the church[\/b][\/color][\/size][\/font]\n [font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#2f2f2f]Can we bring a program that we would like the ceremony to go by, including reading done by family members?[\/color][\/size][\/font][font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#800080][b] This is possible[\/b][\/color][\/size][\/font]\n [font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#2f2f2f]Do the steel drum band play their own music or can you ask them to play certain songs?  [\/color][\/size][\/font][font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#800080][b]You may forward to us your selections.[\/b][\/color][\/size][\/font]\n [font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#2f2f2f]If we provided a picture of the wedding cake that we would like, is it possible to get something made close to it?[\/color][\/size][\/font][font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#800080][b]We would do our best to match it[\/b][\/color][\/size][\/font][font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#2f2f2f] Do we have to bring our own knife and server?[\/color][\/size][\/font][font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#a1009f][b]No[\/b][\/color][\/size][\/font]\n [font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#2f2f2f]Can we rent the gazebo and sound system for the night of our wedding, August 6th, 2011[\/color][\/size][\/font][font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#800080][b]?this is possible at a cost of US500 for 2 hours-8:45pm-10:45pm[\/b][\/color][\/size][\/font]\n [font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#2f2f2f]I heard you can have tiki torches lighting the beach around the gazebo for the dance, is this true? if so, how much does it cost?[\/color][\/size][\/font][font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#800080][b]This can be made available at a cost of uS35 each[\/b][\/color][\/size][\/font]\n [font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#2f2f2f]Is there anywhere on or close by the resort to continue the party after our dance is over?[\/color][\/size][\/font][font=Tahoma][size=2][color=#800080][b]The disco will be open until 3pm[\/b][\/color][\/size][\/font][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1322212,"PostDate":1288120389,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> SOOO helpful! I think from the pictures too that the rectabgular tables that there are 4 on each side..so really tables of 8.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Now to just get a sample menu for both...do any of you lovely ladies have it?<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Espejo2be<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hey girl, I had a few questions to ask the assistant wedding planner to help me make a few decisions on things, just figured i'd post it in case some of you had the same questions, i know how hard it is to get ahold of Beverly...<br \/> <br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">When do I have to make a decision on what package I would like to have? <\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>At least 3 months prior to wedding date<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">How much of a deposit do you need and when?<\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>25% of wedding package<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">Are the Garden Grill and the Italian resturants the only two that can have a semi private reception? <\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>Yes<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">Do you have any pictures of the locations that you can have a semi private reception<\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>?Please see attached<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">Are kids incld in the max amount of people for each package? or is the max just for adults?<\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong> Yes<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">Do you have any linens for ceremony or reception? white? colored? are they incld in package price?<\/font><font color=\"#40005f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong> <\/strong><\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>We offer white linen for both the ceremony and reception.<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">Can we bring our own colored linens if you don't have any<\/font><font color=\"#40005f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>?Yes you may<\/strong><\/font><font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"> are the tables long rectangle? square? round? <\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>Square tables are joined to accommodate the number of guests<\/strong><\/font><font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"> and what are their measurements? <\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>We will get back to you on this<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">What is incld in the ceremony decorations?<\/font><font color=\"#a1009f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong> <\/strong><\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>White fabric draping the gazebo and flowers from the garden. If flowers are not available we will use tulle to match your color scheme<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">Can we have a catholic priest for our ceremony? does it cost extra? <\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>Please note that the catholic priest does not perform weddings outside the church<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">Can we bring a program that we would like the ceremony to go by, including reading done by family members?<\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong> This is possible<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">Do the steel drum band play their own music or can you ask them to play certain songs? \u00a0<\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>You may forward to us your selections.<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">If we provided a picture of the wedding cake that we would like, is it possible to get something made close to it?<\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>We would do our best to match it<\/strong><\/font><font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"> Do we have to bring our own knife and server?<\/font><font color=\"#a1009f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>No<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">Can we rent the gazebo and sound system for the night of our wedding, August 6th, 2011<\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>?this is possible at a cost of US500 for 2 hours-8:45pm-10:45pm<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">I heard you can have tiki torches lighting the beach around the gazebo for the dance, is this true? if so, how much does it cost?<\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>This can be made available at a cost of uS35 each<\/strong><\/font><br \/> <font color=\"#2f2f2f\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\">Is there anywhere on or close by the resort to continue the party after our dance is over?<\/font><font color=\"#800080\" face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"><strong>The disco will be open until 3pm<\/strong><\/font><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Today I marry my bestfriend, the one I laugh with, the one I love.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kfairful@alumni.uoguelph.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1272162450,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227617.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katelynn","Id":227617,"Name":"katelynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9c5182fcf445acbb1e0123bc110c527a","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]lsmith211[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi everyone, \n \n I&#039;m getting married at the GBP in April 2011, and this thread\/forum has been a lifesaver!  Although I feel like a slacker compared to most of you - you&#039;re all shaming me into doing much more than I thought I would for a DW [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif[\/img] But there are just so many great ideas!!  Anyone else going to be there from April 1-8?[\/quote] \n \n \n I am !! I just got confirmation that we are getting Married on April 7th. What is your date?","Attachments":[],"Id":1322648,"PostDate":1288142475,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>lsmith211<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi everyone,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm getting married at the GBP in April 2011, and this thread\/forum has been a lifesaver!\u00a0 Although I feel like a slacker compared to most of you - you're all shaming me into doing much more than I thought I would for a DW <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" height=\"16\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"16\" \/><\/span>\u00a0But there are just so many great ideas!!\u00a0 Anyone else going to be there from April 1-8?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> I am !! I just got confirmation that we are getting Married on April 7th. What is your date?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stefanichayer@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1287873579,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233439.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":149,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"schayer","Id":233439,"Name":"schayer","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bb5086c8abfcce2c027f3c0fc3a747a3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wow thank god this website exist!! This is so GREAT! Without having talk to Beverly about it, i already have an idea of what the flowers looks like, the cost, the restaurants etc. Now my only concern is does the &amp;quot;Free wedding package&amp;quot; exist? i have seen a few post&amp;nbsp;saying that its discontinued.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; About two weeks ago (when i first inquired about the wedding),&amp;nbsp;the WC&amp;nbsp;sent me a document. It&#039;s called &amp;quot; Wedding_Package_with_incl_2010_-_2011&amp;quot;. So hopefully it is still applicable.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I think that StephAli, asked about that. Did you get an answer?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; BTW- I&#039;m getting married on April 7Th!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1322682,"PostDate":1288145542,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wow thank god this website exist!! This is so GREAT! Without having talk to Beverly about it, i already have an idea of what the flowers looks like, the cost, the restaurants etc. Now my only concern is does the \"Free wedding package\" exist? i have seen a few post\u00a0saying that its discontinued.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> About two weeks ago (when i first inquired about the wedding),\u00a0the WC\u00a0sent me a document. It's called \" Wedding_Package_with_incl_2010_-_2011\". So hopefully it is still applicable.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I think that StephAli, asked about that. Did you get an answer?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> BTW- I'm getting married on April 7Th!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stefanichayer@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1287873579,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233439.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":149,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"schayer","Id":233439,"Name":"schayer","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a9431b42a1fc111e2f1926af1b0a9f38","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Schayer - we get married on April 5 so we&#039;ll be there at the same time!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; With regards to the free package, I was also told it doesn&#039;t exist.&amp;nbsp; I booked mine at the beginning of July, and we went with the Sunshine Package - I think this used to be the free one (it is the most basic) but now it costs $1100.&amp;nbsp; Too bad I didn&#039;t get engaged a few months earlier!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Katelynn - I emailed Beverly to get the menu options a few weeks ago, but haven&#039;t received a reponse.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ll post it if I ever hear back.....&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1323333,"PostDate":1288210133,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Schayer - we get married on April 5 so we'll be there at the same time!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> With regards to the free package, I was also told it doesn't exist.\u00a0 I booked mine at the beginning of July, and we went with the Sunshine Package - I think this used to be the free one (it is the most basic) but now it costs $1100.\u00a0 Too bad I didn't get engaged a few months earlier!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Katelynn - I emailed Beverly to get the menu options a few weeks ago, but haven't received a reponse.\u00a0 I'll post it if I ever hear back.....<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leahsmith21@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1276048572,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228989.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lsmith211","Id":228989,"Name":"lsmith211","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c8a61324ed85cdbc772ab1c7a865b774","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi ladies!! FINALLY have a response from Beverly...(I emailed her in AUGUST!)&amp;nbsp; Oh well, at least all of you are keeping me calm when I have to wait months for a response! lol.&amp;nbsp; Here is what I found out and she sent a long a few pictures.&amp;nbsp; Hope this helps!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Hi Beverly!\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; How are you?&amp;nbsp; I Hope that you are having a nice summer.&amp;nbsp; I was just wondering since we reserved our date for July 23, 2011, what was the next step?&amp;nbsp; Do we need to put a deposit on our package?&amp;nbsp; Just want to make sure we stay on track of what we need to do to make sure our date doesn&#039;t get dropped.   Also, I have just a few other questions..&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"color: #0000ff\"&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #0000ff\"&gt;Please be advised that a deposit of 25% on the wedding package selected will be required at least 3 months into your wedding. I have attached a credit card form which should be filled out and returned to us during that time. The credit card payment - we will require a copy of id and credit card copy of the holder.  &lt;\/span&gt;  &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=\"color: #ff0000\"&gt;Sorry&amp;nbsp;ladies, I don&#039;t have the form&amp;nbsp;bc she forgot to attach it but when she does I&#039;ll put it on here!&lt;\/span&gt;\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n --How do I confirm that I will definitely have the gazebo for our wedding reception on July 23, 2011?&amp;nbsp; I just want to make sure that we are able to use the reception venue that we are expecting and hoping for.&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #0000ff\"&gt;The gazebo is already confirmed for you for your special day.  &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;\n &amp;nbsp;\n --At the gazebo for the reception are there lights down there?&amp;nbsp; Is there places to plug stuff in?&amp;nbsp; I was wondering if we could bring some sort of lanterns or anything to be strung up in the gazebo.&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #0000ff\"&gt;The wedding ceremony will take place at the gazebo and by reception I am taking it that you are confirming the gazebo for dance and party for the evening.&amp;nbsp; Dinner reception will be held at one of our a la carte dinning rooms in a semi private area.\t&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #ff0000\"&gt;I dont think she understood my question...so do any of you know if we can put up lights or strands of lanterns??&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n --If we choose to rent just the gazebo (no DJ) do we need to bring our own cd\/ipod player or will there be a sound system set up down there?&amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=\"color: #0000ff\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You do have the choices of bringing your own cd and ipod as a backup or the dj normally plays for the evening from his own selections.  &lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n &amp;nbsp;\n --Can we play music at dinner?&amp;nbsp; (If we bring our own player).&amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=\"color: #0000ff\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Music will not be allowed at the dinner area as it is a semi private dinner and not private to the group, unless you wish to have the area closed out to the group entirely.&amp;nbsp; Close out fee ONLY is USD2500.00 not inclusive of dinner or wedding packages.  &lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n &amp;nbsp;\n --Can you please give me some references for a steel drum band?&amp;nbsp; We are interested in hiring one for the ceremony and a little bit after the ceremony. Do we reserve this or do you? &lt;span style=\"color: #0000ff\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The resort will be delighted in reserving our very reputable steel band .&amp;nbsp; Kindly reconfirm the steel band request closer to the wedding.  &lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n &amp;nbsp;\n --After the ceremony, what happens?&amp;nbsp; We are having a 2:30 ceremony and I&#039;ve been told by another GBP bride that immediately after the ceremony there is champagne and you cut your cake?&amp;nbsp; As well as first dances?&amp;nbsp; I was wondering if you could give me a schedule so that I can know for our programs and for our photographer in advance of arriving in Jamaica.&lt;span style=\"color: #0000ff\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ORDER OF CEREMONY&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"color: #0000ff\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Musical Prelude\n Procession\n Greeting &amp;amp; Prayer\n Exchange of Vows\n Prayer\n Exchange of Rings\n Signing of Register (Duet \u00e2\u20ac\u0153After All \u00e2\u20ac\u201c will be sung by soloists)\n Pronouncement\n Recession\n Champagne reception\n Cutting of the wedding Cake\n First dance of the bride and groom\n Photos\n Dinner.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n &amp;nbsp;\n --How does it work for the gazebo reception if we just buy alcohol from the resort instead of paying the $15p\/p\/hr for a bar to be set up?&amp;nbsp; T&lt;span style=\"color: #0000ff\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;he alcohol can be purchased from the resort, however the cost of USD15.00 pp per hour, comes with the service of your own bar tender.&amp;nbsp; The cost will then be applied separately&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n &amp;nbsp;\n --Could you send me the pictures for bouquets that are available?&amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=\"color: #0000ff\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please find sample bouquets inclusive in your wedding package.&amp;nbsp; Please find that you can upgrade your flowers and arrangements by visiting our florist website at &lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img alt=\"TROPICAL_BOUQUET_AND_BOUT_SAMPLE.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/191521\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Gazebo&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;img alt=\"wedding_gazebo_simple_decor_2.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/191523\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;chair ties&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;img alt=\"wedding_gazebo_with_ties_and_chair_covers.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/191525\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Garden Grill&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;img alt=\"the_grill_3.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/191527\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Dolce Vita (Italian)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;img alt=\"Dolce_Vita.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/191529\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1323857,"PostDate":1288276277,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi ladies!! FINALLY have a response from Beverly...(I emailed her in AUGUST!)\u00a0 Oh well, at least all of you are keeping me calm when I have to wait months for a response! lol.\u00a0 Here is what I found out and she sent a long a few pictures.\u00a0 Hope this helps!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hi Beverly!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> How are you?\u00a0 I Hope that you are having a nice summer.\u00a0 I was just wondering since we reserved our date for July 23, 2011, what was the next step?\u00a0 Do we need to put a deposit on our package?\u00a0 Just want to make sure we stay on track of what we need to do to make sure our date doesn't get dropped.\u00a0\u00a0 Also, I have just a few other questions..\u00a0<span  style=\"color: #0000ff\"> <\/span><strong><span  style=\"color: #0000ff\">Please be advised that a deposit of 25% on the wedding package selected will be required at least 3 months into your wedding. I have attached a credit card form which should be filled out and returned to us during that time. The credit card payment - we will require a copy of id and credit card copy of the holder.\u00a0\u00a0<\/span>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span  style=\"color: #ff0000\">Sorry\u00a0ladies, I don't have the form\u00a0bc she forgot to attach it but when she does I'll put it on here!<\/span><br \/> \u00a0<\/strong><br \/> --How do I confirm that I will definitely have the gazebo for our wedding reception on July 23, 2011?\u00a0 I just want to make sure that we are able to use the reception venue that we are expecting and hoping for.\u00a0 <strong><span  style=\"color: #0000ff\">The gazebo is already confirmed for you for your special day.\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/strong><br \/> \u00a0<br \/> --At the gazebo for the reception are there lights down there?\u00a0 Is there places to plug stuff in?\u00a0 I was wondering if we could bring some sort of lanterns or anything to be strung up in the gazebo.\u00a0 <strong><span  style=\"color: #0000ff\">The wedding ceremony will take place at the gazebo and by reception I am taking it that you are confirming the gazebo for dance and party for the evening.\u00a0 Dinner reception will be held at one of our a la carte dinning rooms in a semi private area.\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color: #ff0000\">I dont think she understood my question...so do any of you know if we can put up lights or strands of lanterns??<\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <br \/> --If we choose to rent just the gazebo (no DJ) do we need to bring our own cd\/ipod player or will there be a sound system set up down there?\u00a0 <span  style=\"color: #0000ff\"><strong>You do have the choices of bringing your own cd and ipod as a backup or the dj normally plays for the evening from his own selections.\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><br \/> \u00a0<br \/> --Can we play music at dinner?\u00a0 (If we bring our own player).\u00a0 <span  style=\"color: #0000ff\"><strong>Music will not be allowed at the dinner area as it is a semi private dinner and not private to the group, unless you wish to have the area closed out to the group entirely.\u00a0 Close out fee ONLY is USD2500.00 not inclusive of dinner or wedding packages.\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><br \/> \u00a0<br \/> --Can you please give me some references for a steel drum band?\u00a0 We are interested in hiring one for the ceremony and a little bit after the ceremony. Do we reserve this or do you? <span  style=\"color: #0000ff\"><strong>The resort will be delighted in reserving our very reputable steel band .\u00a0 Kindly reconfirm the steel band request closer to the wedding.\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><br \/> \u00a0<br \/> --After the ceremony, what happens?\u00a0 We are having a 2:30 ceremony and I've been told by another GBP bride that immediately after the ceremony there is champagne and you cut your cake?\u00a0 As well as first dances?\u00a0 I was wondering if you could give me a schedule so that I can know for our programs and for our photographer in advance of arriving in Jamaica.<span  style=\"color: #0000ff\"><strong>ORDER OF CEREMONY<\/strong><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color: #0000ff\"><strong>Musical Prelude<br \/> Procession<br \/> Greeting & Prayer<br \/> Exchange of Vows<br \/> Prayer<br \/> Exchange of Rings<br \/> Signing of Register (Duet \u00e2\u20ac\u0153After All \u00e2\u20ac\u201c will be sung by soloists)<br \/> Pronouncement<br \/> Recession<br \/> Champagne reception<br \/> Cutting of the wedding Cake<br \/> First dance of the bride and groom<br \/> Photos<br \/> Dinner.<\/strong><\/span><br \/> \u00a0<br \/> --How does it work for the gazebo reception if we just buy alcohol from the resort instead of paying the $15p\/p\/hr for a bar to be set up?\u00a0 T<span  style=\"color: #0000ff\"><strong>he alcohol can be purchased from the resort, however the cost of USD15.00 pp per hour, comes with the service of your own bar tender.\u00a0 The cost will then be applied separately<\/strong><\/span><br \/> \u00a0<br \/> --Could you send me the pictures for bouquets that are available?\u00a0 <span  style=\"color: #0000ff\"><strong>Please find sample bouquets inclusive in your wedding package.\u00a0 Please find that you can upgrade your flowers and arrangements by visiting our florist website at <\/strong><\/span><strong><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"TROPICAL_BOUQUET_AND_BOUT_SAMPLE.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/191521\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong>Gazebo<\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"wedding_gazebo_simple_decor_2.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/191523\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong>chair ties<\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"wedding_gazebo_with_ties_and_chair_covers.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/191525\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong>Garden Grill<\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"the_grill_3.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/191527\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong>Dolce Vita (Italian)<\/strong><\/p> <p> <strong><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Dolce_Vita.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/191529\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mekanabr@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1259797911,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223677.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":299,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mekanabr","Id":223677,"Name":"mekanabr","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"44634","Title":"Any Gran Bahia Principe Runaway Bay Brides out there?","LastPostDate":1467934433},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5564,"TotalPages":557,"CurrentPage":390,"NextPage":400,"PreviousPage":380,"LastPage":5560},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
