{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4171974da04fa16189876e986b7177c4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; oh and a big HELLO and CONGRATS!!&amp;nbsp;To all the new brides on our GBP thread!!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" height=\"22\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/welcome3.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"111\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1323859,"PostDate":1288276349,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> oh and a big HELLO and CONGRATS!!\u00a0To all the new brides on our GBP thread!!!!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" height=\"22\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/welcome3.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"111\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mekanabr@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1259797911,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223677.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":299,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mekanabr","Id":223677,"Name":"mekanabr","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"90d9fce491dc2b5d518a881778bc7df1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks so much Mekanbr - those were pretty much the same questions I&#039;ve been waiting for Beverly to respond to!   And it&#039;s great to have pics of the restaurants from different perspectives - gives us a better idea of what they look like&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1323920,"PostDate":1288279402,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks so much Mekanbr - those were pretty much the same questions I've been waiting for Beverly to respond to!\u00a0\u00a0 And it's great to have pics of the restaurants from different perspectives - gives us a better idea of what they look like<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leahsmith21@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1276048572,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228989.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lsmith211","Id":228989,"Name":"lsmith211","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"536909bb53ce86c0072ff9472e2deb52","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; thanks again for posting all that info as I am sure we all have the same questions!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I emailed her last week and she already emailed me back! wahoo!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I asked if we are having the free wedding package if we need to put down a 25% deposit for the rest of the stuff (gazebo, additional 20 for dinner, additional flowers, etc) and she said it would be due when we meet with her when we get there...so good to know for the rest of you also going with the free package :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am still wanting to know dinner options for the Grill and Italian as I was going to make menu&#039;s from Vistaprint before we leave. I guess I will worry about it closer to the time...thats the problem with being anal retentive! haha&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1324224,"PostDate":1288290628,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> thanks again for posting all that info as I am sure we all have the same questions!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I emailed her last week and she already emailed me back! wahoo!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I asked if we are having the free wedding package if we need to put down a 25% deposit for the rest of the stuff (gazebo, additional 20 for dinner, additional flowers, etc) and she said it would be due when we meet with her when we get there...so good to know for the rest of you also going with the free package <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am still wanting to know dinner options for the Grill and Italian as I was going to make menu's from Vistaprint before we leave. I guess I will worry about it closer to the time...thats the problem with being anal retentive! haha<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Today I marry my bestfriend, the one I laugh with, the one I love.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kfairful@alumni.uoguelph.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1272162450,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227617.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katelynn","Id":227617,"Name":"katelynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"834b76ddfc20424f00916625ff704a31","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks for all the info!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;ve been waiting for answers for a WHILE from her as well... the last batch I sent, she actually emailed me back a day after saying &amp;quot;thanks for your mail, I will respond tomorrow&amp;quot; ... that was over a week ago...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; That really sucks about the menus! I really wanted to get started on all my stationary...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1324283,"PostDate":1288292883,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks for all the info!<\/p> <p> I've been waiting for answers for a WHILE from her as well... the last batch I sent, she actually emailed me back a day after saying \"thanks for your mail, I will respond tomorrow\" ... that was over a week ago...<\/p> <p> That really sucks about the menus! I really wanted to get started on all my stationary...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Married my best friend 04\/28\/11 at the Gran Bahia Principe Runaway Bay<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"trista.lundquist@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1273793347,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228171.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tris","Id":228171,"Name":"tris","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"09e6db033e3841c1ac825931cb707e3a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wow...you ladies are so very thorough!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; One question that we have been trying to find out - don&#039;t know if you ladies know about it or are experiencing the same issue...but through our travel agent &amp;amp; funjet vacations, children 12 and under stay free with 2 paid adults at the GBP...it seems that the special is only posted through the end of December of this year&amp;nbsp;and it is not being applied to our booking in May of next year!&amp;nbsp; This is a problem!&amp;nbsp; That&#039;s a huge discount and I want to know if it will be an option come next year!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Have any of you heard of this??&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1324602,"PostDate":1288304786,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wow...you ladies are so very thorough!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> One question that we have been trying to find out - don't know if you ladies know about it or are experiencing the same issue...but through our travel agent & funjet vacations, children 12 and under stay free with 2 paid adults at the GBP...it seems that the special is only posted through the end of December of this year\u00a0and it is not being applied to our booking in May of next year!\u00a0 This is a problem!\u00a0 That's a huge discount and I want to know if it will be an option come next year!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Have any of you heard of this??<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277427137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5979c8b0efad42bffca92b01b29779c5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey ladies! love the question posts!! It is so helpful! Thanks for sharing!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; For clarification on the packages, here are the attachments that I was sent (Note that the&amp;nbsp;FREE Package DOES exist) &lt;img alt=\"\" height=\"49\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"60\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;font face=\"Arial\"&gt;Good evening Jenny:&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt; &lt;\/font&gt;\n \n &lt;font face=\"sans-serif\" size=\"2\"&gt;Thank you for your below mail. &amp;nbsp;Please find that the free wedding package is a promotional package which caters to two to 16 persons. &amp;nbsp;It is not inclusive of legal &amp;amp; minister&#039;s &amp;nbsp;fees of USD400.00 + 16.5% taxes. &amp;nbsp;Please find that I have attached a copy of the package for your review. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt; &lt;\/font&gt;\n \n &lt;font face=\"sans-serif\" size=\"2\"&gt;Kindly advise if you wish to move further with the promotional package or the sunshine package. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt; &lt;\/font&gt;\n \n &lt;font face=\"sans-serif\" size=\"2\"&gt;Kind regards&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"&gt; &lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;table&gt; &lt;tbody&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt; &lt;font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"2\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"3\"&gt; &lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt; &lt;font color=\"#806210\" face=\"Verdana\" size=\"2\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beverly Antoine&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;font face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"3\"&gt; &lt;span style=\"display: none\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/tbody&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;7988&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;FREE WEDDING Package[1].doc&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;79&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;doc&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;7989&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Wedding Package with incl 2010.doc&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;4,762&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;doc&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1324685,"PostDate":1288313527,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey ladies! love the question posts!! It is so helpful! Thanks for sharing!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> For clarification on the packages, here are the attachments that I was sent (Note that the\u00a0FREE Package DOES exist) <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" height=\"49\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"60\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <font face=\"Arial\">Good evening Jenny:<\/font><font face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"> <\/font><br \/> <br \/> <font face=\"sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Thank you for your below mail. \u00a0Please find that the free wedding package is a promotional package which caters to two to 16 persons. \u00a0It is not inclusive of legal & minister's \u00a0fees of USD400.00 + 16.5% taxes. \u00a0Please find that I have attached a copy of the package for your review. \u00a0<\/font><font face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"> <\/font><br \/> <br \/> <font face=\"sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Kindly advise if you wish to move further with the promotional package or the sunshine package. \u00a0<\/font><font face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"> <\/font><br \/> <br \/> <font face=\"sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Kind regards<\/font><font face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"2\"> <\/font><\/p> <table> <tbody> <tr> <td> <font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"2\">\u00a0<\/font><font face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"3\"> <\/font><\/td> <\/tr> <tr> <td> <font color=\"#806210\" face=\"Verdana\" size=\"2\"><strong>Beverly Antoine<\/strong><\/font><font face=\"Tahoma\" size=\"3\"> <span  style=\"display: none\">\u00a0<\/span><\/font><\/td> <\/tr> <\/tbody> <\/table> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"7988\",\"name\":\"FREE WEDDING Package[1].doc\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"79\",\"type\":\"doc\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"7989\",\"name\":\"Wedding Package with incl 2010.doc\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"4,762\",\"type\":\"doc\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennyslack@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1262229008,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224208.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennypenny23","Id":224208,"Name":"jennypenny23","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d66d34a05ee64e012035902838fa6e09","RawContent":"I didnt hear about this but it is very interesting... but we are flying with AirTransat - dont know if this makes a difference or not?! We have 1 kid going but it would be interesting to find out. I would say when I booked it was in effect so I plan for this promotion to be offered to me or Ill be looking for alternative flights...I guess it helps sometimes to be rude. \n \n I had something similar with AirTransat...they were not going to offer us anything as a group which made me VERY angry as we have 42 people. I emailed them and said what can you do for us as SunWing does this and they emailed me stuff they will do....interesting eh! haha\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]missy&amp;amp;eric2011[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Wow...you ladies are so very thorough! \n \n One question that we have been trying to find out - don&#039;t know if you ladies know about it or are experiencing the same issue...but through our travel agent &amp;amp; funjet vacations, children 12 and under stay free with 2 paid adults at the GBP...it seems that the special is only posted through the end of December of this year and it is not being applied to our booking in May of next year!  This is a problem!  That&#039;s a huge discount and I want to know if it will be an option come next year!!! \n \n Have any of you heard of this??[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1325026,"PostDate":1288367334,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> I didnt hear about this but it is very interesting... but we are flying with AirTransat - dont\u00a0know if this makes a difference or not?!\u00a0We have 1 kid going but it would be interesting to find out. I would say when I booked it was in effect so I plan for this promotion to be offered to me or Ill be looking for alternative flights...I guess it helps sometimes to be rude.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I had something similar with AirTransat...they were not going to offer us anything as a group which made me VERY angry as we have 42 people. I emailed them and said what can you do for us as SunWing does this and they emailed me stuff they will do....interesting eh! haha<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>missy&eric2011<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Wow...you ladies are so very thorough!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> One question that we have been trying to find out - don't know if you ladies know about it or are experiencing the same issue...but through our travel agent & funjet vacations, children 12 and under stay free with 2 paid adults at the GBP...it seems that the special is only posted through the end of December of this year\u00a0and it is not being applied to our booking in May of next year!\u00a0 This is a problem!\u00a0 That's a huge discount and I want to know if it will be an option come next year!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Have any of you heard of this??<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Today I marry my bestfriend, the one I laugh with, the one I love.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kfairful@alumni.uoguelph.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1272162450,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227617.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katelynn","Id":227617,"Name":"katelynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b2c0a3e8354b9599d2606a7ad2a8bda2","RawContent":"Hmm...good idea!  My TA finally got back to us today and said that she is not getting any response from the resort as to if it is being extended into next year...so she has NOW (we have been waiting for an answer for 2 weeks...so nice she finally decided to pursue another option) emailed funjet vacations to see if they are offering it in 2011.  I think you would have run into the same problem that we did because our dates of travel are not until next year; the promotion only covered travel dates through December of this year.  But I will be sure to keep you updated on what I find out...It may be an offer that other companies will extend as well.\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]katelynn[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n I didnt hear about this but it is very interesting... but we are flying with AirTransat - dont know if this makes a difference or not?! We have 1 kid going but it would be interesting to find out. I would say when I booked it was in effect so I plan for this promotion to be offered to me or Ill be looking for alternative flights...I guess it helps sometimes to be rude. \n \n I had something similar with AirTransat...they were not going to offer us anything as a group which made me VERY angry as we have 42 people. I emailed them and said what can you do for us as SunWing does this and they emailed me stuff they will do....interesting eh! haha\n   \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1325093,"PostDate":1288371632,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Hmm...good idea!\u00a0 My TA finally got back to us today and said that she is not getting any response from the resort as to if it is being extended into next year...so she has NOW (we have been waiting for an answer for 2 weeks...so nice she finally decided to pursue another option) emailed funjet vacations to see if they are offering it in 2011.\u00a0 I think you would have run into the same problem that we did because our dates of travel are not until next year; the promotion only covered travel dates through December of this year.\u00a0 But I will be sure to keep you updated on what I find out...It may be an offer that other companies will extend as well.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>katelynn<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> I didnt hear about this but it is very interesting... but we are flying with AirTransat - dont\u00a0know if this makes a difference or not?!\u00a0We have 1 kid going but it would be interesting to find out. I would say when I booked it was in effect so I plan for this promotion to be offered to me or Ill be looking for alternative flights...I guess it helps sometimes to be rude.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I had something similar with AirTransat...they were not going to offer us anything as a group which made me VERY angry as we have 42 people. I emailed them and said what can you do for us as SunWing does this and they emailed me stuff they will do....interesting eh! haha<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277427137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d6f7125f339f7882e425abf65778a6d5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; When i asked Beverly abuot the free wedding package she said that it was too late, and I&#039;ve had my wedding booked since the spring, I think April we had it booked and our deposit down.&amp;nbsp; And now she&#039;s telling you that its okay? Ridiculous.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Ugh, I&#039;ve decided to give up planning anything else.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m just going to go with the flow and not think about details.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m not going to stress out, I want to have a good time.&amp;nbsp; Hopefully I won&#039;t have to make another decision until I&#039;m there.&amp;nbsp; Though there is a part of me thats super worried she&#039;s messed up the booking and I&#039;m going to get down there and there is not going to be a wedding!&amp;nbsp; That would BLOW!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1325452,"PostDate":1288391421,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> When i asked Beverly abuot the free wedding package she said that it was too late, and I've had my wedding booked since the spring, I think April we had it booked and our deposit down.\u00a0 And now she's telling you that its okay? Ridiculous.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Ugh, I've decided to give up planning anything else.\u00a0 I'm just going to go with the flow and not think about details.\u00a0 I'm not going to stress out, I want to have a good time.\u00a0 Hopefully I won't have to make another decision until I'm there.\u00a0 Though there is a part of me thats super worried she's messed up the booking and I'm going to get down there and there is not going to be a wedding!\u00a0 That would BLOW!!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Gran Bahia Principe - Runaway Bay - February 22, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"akua420@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1270637423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akua420","Id":227119,"Name":"akua420","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4bbb297b086dea15319f72b8311c59e4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Oh No akua420- Im so sorry to hear of all of the frustration on your end!! I am going to take the same positive attitude that you have and just say that your wedding will be FABULOUS in the end! Everything will work out and your special day will be marvelous! &lt;img alt=\"\" height=\"31\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/pinkie.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"31\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1325510,"PostDate":1288397508,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Oh No akua420- Im so sorry to hear of all of the frustration on your end!! I am going to take the same positive attitude that you have and just say that your wedding will be FABULOUS in the end! Everything will work out and your special day will be marvelous! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" height=\"31\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/pinkie.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"31\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennyslack@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1262229008,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224208.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennypenny23","Id":224208,"Name":"jennypenny23","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5564,"TotalPages":557,"CurrentPage":400,"NextPage":410,"PreviousPage":390,"LastPage":5560},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
