> User bellabride2018 (287346)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"39fee0304eaca0ba6604b07f269fce68","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; About the menu... can you switch stuff around? I was looking at it and it seems like every menu has a few things I like and a few that I wouldn&#039;t really care for.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I guess they&#039;ll be changing it a bit for 2011 anyway though, right?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I emailed her like 3 weeks ago and this was one of the questions (menu stuff), she emailed me the day after saying &amp;quot;Thanks, I&#039;ll answer these questions for you tomorrow&amp;quot; ... nothing since then. I know she&#039;s busy but it gets super frustrating... I want to start on all my stationary stuff (programs, menus, etc) soon because I know it&#039;s going to take me a while to do them up to my own personal standards. It&#039;s really tough designing stuff for your self when you&#039;re a graphic designer... nothing ever satisfies me! Haha.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; On a more fun note, we went and did our gift registry today!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1332121,"PostDate":1289090618,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> About the menu... can you switch stuff around? I was looking at it and it seems like every menu has a few things I like and a few that I wouldn't really care for.<\/p> <p> I guess they'll be changing it a bit for 2011 anyway though, right?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I emailed her like 3 weeks ago and this was one of the questions (menu stuff), she emailed me the day after saying \"Thanks, I'll answer these questions for you tomorrow\" ... nothing since then. I know she's busy but it gets super frustrating... I want to start on all my stationary stuff (programs, menus, etc) soon because I know it's going to take me a while to do them up to my own personal standards. It's really tough designing stuff for your self when you're a graphic designer... nothing ever satisfies me! Haha.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> On a more fun note, we went and did our gift registry today!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Married my best friend 04\/28\/11 at the Gran Bahia Principe Runaway Bay<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"trista.lundquist@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1273793347,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228171.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tris","Id":228171,"Name":"tris","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"13a267295b0a95080072798c48850b31","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks Ismith211! Im glad to see that we have options....but I agree with tris...it would be nice if we could do a little switcheroo with some of the options and customize it based on our preferences....hmmm.. maybe it will change between now and feb 1st though..&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1332167,"PostDate":1289099219,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks Ismith211! Im glad to see that we have options....but I agree with tris...it would be nice if we could do a little switcheroo with some of the options and customize it based on our preferences....hmmm.. maybe it will change between now and feb 1st though..<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennyslack@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1262229008,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224208.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennypenny23","Id":224208,"Name":"jennypenny23","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce40d85bfb2f06d4a9776217726fb051","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Does anyone know if you book your hair before you go&amp;nbsp;or when you get there &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/\/huh.gif\" width=\"\" height=\"\" class=\"bbcode_smiley\" \/&gt; HELP :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1332300,"PostDate":1289142510,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Does anyone know if you book your hair before you go\u00a0or when you get there <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/\/huh.gif\" width=\"\" height=\"\" class=\"bbcode_smiley\" \/><\/span> HELP <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tmmartell@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1284229239,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232240.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TMwedding2011","Id":232240,"Name":"TMwedding2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"72f9d1491d244ebd4fcbcde26766b101","RawContent":"I am sure you can email the spa before you get there...or email Beverly too. I think with most packages too you get a free hair trail so you might be able to book that at the same time.\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]TMwedding2011[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Does anyone know if you book your hair before you go or when you get there [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/\/huh.gif[\/img] HELP :)[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1332404,"PostDate":1289159864,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am sure you can email the spa before you get there...or email Beverly too. I think with most packages too you get a free hair trail so you might be able to book that at the same time.<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>TMwedding2011<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Does anyone know if you book your hair before you go\u00a0or when you get there <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"bbcode_smiley\" height=\"1\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/\/huh.gif\" width=\"1\" \/><\/span> HELP <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Today I marry my bestfriend, the one I laugh with, the one I love.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kfairful@alumni.uoguelph.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1272162450,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227617.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katelynn","Id":227617,"Name":"katelynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4fc6675fb747d3c4b895705f29b544dc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; finally a menu!!! thank you so much for posting this&amp;nbsp;lsmith211!!!!!!! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1332512,"PostDate":1289174634,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> finally a menu!!! thank you so much for posting this\u00a0lsmith211!!!!!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mekanabr@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1259797911,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223677.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":299,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mekanabr","Id":223677,"Name":"mekanabr","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"16c68ab6afa648c3f287d131263bec7e","RawContent":"Good idea; asking about a menu!  The things I never would have thought of!  [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/blush2.gif[\/img]  So glad you ladies are here for this stuff!  Thank you for posting!!!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]lsmith211[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi everyone, \n \n I finally heard back from Beverly and she answered some of my questions...  I also asked her to confirm my wedding date and time as she hasn&#039;t charged my credit card with my deposit yet, and she wrote back saying I was confirmed for April 4, when I booked it April 5!!!  I almost had a heart attack, but then she wrote back right away saying it was a typo, and I was booked for April 5 - whew!!!  We have some guests flying in late on the 4th, so that would not have been good! \n \n Anyway - to share my info - she sent me the current menu choices, but warned that it is subject to change.  Here&#039;s a copy for anyone that wants an idea of what may be available:  \n \n \n   \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1332918,"PostDate":1289234655,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Good idea; asking about a menu!\u00a0\u00a0The things I never would have thought of!\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" height=\"25\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/blush2.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"25\" \/><\/span>\u00a0 So glad you ladies are here for this stuff!\u00a0 Thank you for posting!!!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>lsmith211<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi everyone,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I finally heard back from Beverly and she answered some of my questions...\u00a0 I also asked her to confirm my wedding date and time as she hasn't charged my credit card with my deposit yet, and she wrote back saying I was confirmed for April 4, when I booked it April 5!!!\u00a0 I almost had a heart attack, but then she wrote back right away saying it was a typo, and I was booked for April 5 - whew!!!\u00a0\u00a0We have some guests flying in late on the 4th, so that would not have been good!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Anyway - to share my info - she sent me the current menu choices, but warned that it is subject to change.\u00a0 Here's a copy for anyone that wants an idea of what may be available:\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"8052\",\"name\":\"GBP Menu Options.pdf\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"474\",\"type\":\"pdf\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277427137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b579ff7db4f5f5158c6fe629a68fb86e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Any reason why i can&#039;t see the menu options?!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; BTW - I&#039;m going to try some dresses tomorrow! i can&#039;t wait!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1333116,"PostDate":1289242832,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Any reason why i can't see the menu options?!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> BTW - I'm going to try some dresses tomorrow! i can't wait!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stefanichayer@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1287873579,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233439.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":149,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"schayer","Id":233439,"Name":"schayer","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2182a023ec7b4ef1d8ec05ec4561eba8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Finally got a reply from Beverly reconfirming my wedding date and time.. My god I hadn&#039;t heard from her in months and was starting to worry! I&#039;m confirmed April 26th, 2011 at 4:30pm&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;ve stayed at this property just this past May if anyone has any questions.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I do know that the construction on the new wing of the hotel is still going on.. hope this doesn&#039;t cause any major problems!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also, if anyone was interested (from Canada) in travel rates please feel free to contact me. I am a travel agent and have booked MANY destination weddings.. including my own!! I can&#039;t wait!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1333723,"PostDate":1289266840,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Finally got a reply from Beverly reconfirming my wedding date and time.. My god I hadn't heard from her in months and was starting to worry! I'm confirmed April 26th, 2011 at 4:30pm<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I've stayed at this property just this past May if anyone has any questions.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I do know that the construction on the new wing of the hotel is still going on.. hope this doesn't cause any major problems!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also, if anyone was interested (from Canada) in travel rates please feel free to contact me. I am a travel agent and have booked MANY destination weddings.. including my own!! I can't wait!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erinhpage@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1289266577,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233812.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ehpage","Id":233812,"Name":"ehpage","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2571c6e05e937a5f8b3a9aab3d4ea056","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I cannot open the menu.&amp;nbsp; Could you copy and paste?&amp;nbsp; I can&#039;t wait to see it..........&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1333985,"PostDate":1289307871,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I cannot open the menu.\u00a0 Could you copy and paste?\u00a0 I can't wait to see it..........<\/p> <p> Thanks<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"40lexie@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1286023913,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232850.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"a084596","Id":232850,"Name":"a084596","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b16c52fd9f7824a7b14a81d68ae91bc6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I cannot&amp;nbsp; seem to open the menu either. Please re-post. Thanks :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1334497,"PostDate":1289329904,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I cannot\u00a0 seem to open the menu either. Please re-post. Thanks <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ulloalaura@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1286602313,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233044.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":268,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chelito","Id":233044,"Name":"chelito","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5564,"TotalPages":557,"CurrentPage":420,"NextPage":430,"PreviousPage":410,"LastPage":5560},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
