{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"14dc29ef3b246df5e6f9059ac8cd378d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; The reason you ladies can&#039;t open it is you&#039;re still &amp;quot;NOOB&amp;quot; to the site. You have to be a least a Junior Member to open documents (have made 150 posts or more).&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I wonder if she&#039;d be nice enough to email it to you if you PM&#039;d her your email address :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1334510,"PostDate":1289330336,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> The reason you ladies can't open it is you're still \"NOOB\" to the site. You have to be a least a Junior Member to open documents (have made 150 posts or more).<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I wonder if she'd be nice enough to email it to you if you PM'd her your email address <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Married my best friend 04\/28\/11 at the Gran Bahia Principe Runaway Bay<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"trista.lundquist@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1273793347,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228171.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tris","Id":228171,"Name":"tris","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b1af901a94a08fe5f5ccc8cf92b4fa49","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Definitely - I&#039;ve already sent it a bunch!&amp;nbsp; Chelito if you PM me with your email address I can send it to you too...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1334695,"PostDate":1289336073,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Definitely - I've already sent it a bunch!\u00a0 Chelito if you PM me with your email address I can send it to you too...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leahsmith21@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1276048572,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228989.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lsmith211","Id":228989,"Name":"lsmith211","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c9f53abc81949d88f1ee8b78c4b5b280","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; HAVE ANY OF YOU BOOKED YOUR HAIR IN ADVANCE ? PLEASE HELP IF YOU KNOW ANYTHING ABOUT IT &lt;img alt=\"\" height=\"18\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheers.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"24\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1336303,"PostDate":1289443236,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> HAVE ANY OF YOU BOOKED YOUR HAIR IN ADVANCE ? PLEASE HELP IF YOU KNOW ANYTHING ABOUT IT <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" height=\"18\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheers.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"24\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tmmartell@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1284229239,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232240.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TMwedding2011","Id":232240,"Name":"TMwedding2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ddbf89e55f0bf6bc23c1409ad679917","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Would you mind sending my a copy of the menu as well!! sskelly15@hotmail.com. I was wondering why I couldn&#039;t open it myself?!? Thanks for the info ladies!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1337893,"PostDate":1289529885,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Would you mind sending my a copy of the menu as well!! sskelly15@hotmail.com. I was wondering why I couldn't open it myself?!? Thanks for the info ladies!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sskelly15@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281987124,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231425.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sskelly","Id":231425,"Name":"sskelly","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bd495a2f66ba84a8c60140ff3fb3ee17","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"post-user-avatar\"&gt; &lt;span class=\"pmenuShow on\" id=\"pMenu-31587\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"display: none\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;TMwedding2011 - you can email the spa and they&#039;ll tell you what time to be there and what time your bridesmaids and rest of bridal party need to be there before the ceremony.&amp;nbsp; they were very helpful!&amp;nbsp; &lt;font face=\"Arial\" size=\"1\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:spabpjam@bahia-principe.com\"&gt;spabpjam@bahia-principe.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1338127,"PostDate":1289568267,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"post-user-avatar\"> <span class=\"pmenuShow on\" id=\"pMenu-31587\"><span  style=\"display: none\">\u00a0<\/span>TMwedding2011 - you can email the spa and they'll tell you what time to be there and what time your bridesmaids and rest of bridal party need to be there before the ceremony.\u00a0 they were very helpful!\u00a0 <font face=\"Arial\" size=\"1\"><a href='mailto:spabpjam@bahia-principe.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>spabpjam@bahia-principe.com<\/a><\/font><\/span><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"daphnetorgal@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1275444609,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228753.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"daphne","Id":228753,"Name":"daphne","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8181634800ed7cf65b118fde13718868","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; HI TMwedding,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I booked my appointment already for my April wedding&amp;nbsp;- you can go onto their website and send an email to book - there is a link on the mail GBP website&amp;nbsp;- if you PM me with your email address and I can forward you the info they sent me - it gives all their services and prices, but if you&#039;re just looking for hair and make-up here is what they sent me:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;em&gt;&lt;font face=\"Arial\"&gt;I inform you that for your bridal style, there&#039;s a charge of 93.50 US$ and you have a trial included, which I suggest you to do it at least two days in advance. For the bridal make-up, there&#039;s a charge of 77 US$ and you have free trial as well, which you can do the same day of your hair trial.\n \n &lt;font size=\"2\"&gt;&amp;nbsp; The price for your bridesmaids are depending of what they are going to do. The prices starts from 38.50US$ for a short hair blow dry up to 66US$ if they want an up-do. The price for the make-up is 60.50 US$.&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;\n \n &lt;font face=\"sans-serif\" size=\"2\"&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp; All the prices are taxes included and everything will be charged to your room, you just pay when you do the Check-Out&lt;\/em&gt;.&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n \n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1338540,"PostDate":1289595608,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> HI TMwedding,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I booked my appointment already for my April wedding\u00a0- you can go onto their website and send an email to book - there is a link on the mail GBP website\u00a0- if you PM me with your email address and I can forward you the info they sent me - it gives all their services and prices, but if you're just looking for hair and make-up here is what they sent me:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <em><font face=\"Arial\">I inform you that for your bridal style, there's a charge of 93.50 US$ and you have a trial included, which I suggest you to do it at least two days in advance. For the bridal make-up, there's a charge of 77 US$ and you have free trial as well, which you can do the same day of your hair trial.<br \/> <br \/> <font size=\"2\">\u00a0 The price for your bridesmaids are depending of what they are going to do. The prices starts from 38.50US$ for a short hair blow dry up to 66US$ if they want an up-do. The price for the make-up is 60.50 US$.<\/font><\/font><\/em><br \/> <br \/> <font face=\"sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><em>\u00a0 All the prices are taxes included and everything will be charged to your room, you just pay when you do the Check-Out<\/em>.<\/font><\/p> <p> <br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leahsmith21@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1276048572,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228989.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lsmith211","Id":228989,"Name":"lsmith211","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5253669c4f24d8915886d4d5175e9433","RawContent":"So my wedding is in June, and after reading your posts I feel like I may be slacking on worrying about things... Can you guys give me any ideas or suggestions for things Im missing ? I booked my date with Beverly, booked our tickets, starting discussing floral with tai flora, booked photographer, found runners I will be ordering closer to the date, found bridesmaid dresses which need to be ordered this month or next month, ordered my dress, shoes, second dress. In my head I&#039;ve picked to do the reception at the Italian restaurant but have not addressed it to Beverly, should I be worried about anything else? Menu cards? Closer to the date I will be figuring out welcome bags, and that&#039;s about with things I had in mind...","Attachments":[],"Id":1339471,"PostDate":1289757432,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So my wedding is in June, and after reading your posts I feel like I may be slacking on worrying about things... Can you guys give me any ideas or suggestions for things Im missing ? I booked my date with Beverly, booked our tickets, starting discussing floral with tai flora, booked photographer, found runners I will be ordering closer to the date, found bridesmaid dresses which need to be ordered this month or next month, ordered my dress, shoes, second dress. In my head I've picked to do the reception at the Italian restaurant but have not addressed it to Beverly, should I be worried about anything else? Menu cards? Closer to the date I will be figuring out welcome bags, and that's about with things I had in mind...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"blondyriley@aim.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1282785574,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231747.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ChrisBC25","Id":231747,"Name":"ChrisBC25","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"29a36a86b1aea27d84c534a7b9fd72ac","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi ChrisBC25,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; To me look, you&amp;nbsp;on top of everything... now&amp;nbsp;I feel like I&#039;m slacking lol. What I&#039;ve accomplished over the past week-end:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We picked our songs for the ceremony!! We are HUGE Beatles fans (both grew up&amp;nbsp;with Beatles fans) so our theme is Beatles. My favorite Beatles song is &amp;quot;Dear Prudence&amp;quot; and I&#039;ll be walking down the aisle to an instrumental\/karaoke version. I&#039;m so excited!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Personally, after reading close to 500 posts on this thread,&amp;nbsp;I have a general idea of pretty much everything... and I&#039;m not even worried a bit...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1339867,"PostDate":1289829198,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi ChrisBC25,<\/p> <p> To me look, you\u00a0on top of everything... now\u00a0I feel like I'm slacking lol. What I've accomplished over the past week-end:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We picked our songs for the ceremony!! We are HUGE Beatles fans (both grew up\u00a0with Beatles fans) so our theme is Beatles. My favorite Beatles song is \"Dear Prudence\" and I'll be walking down the aisle to an instrumental\/karaoke version. I'm so excited!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Personally, after reading close to 500 posts on this thread,\u00a0I have a general idea of pretty much everything... and I'm not even worried a bit...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stefanichayer@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1287873579,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233439.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":149,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"schayer","Id":233439,"Name":"schayer","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"73c38755aad5278099561156db6446b4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I personally didn&#039;t think you picked your restaurant until you got there.&amp;nbsp; i&#039;m using the cake and flowers from the resort too.&amp;nbsp; So all I have gone is booked the vacation, paid, emailed the wedding planner the package we want and booked the date.&amp;nbsp; Thats it.&amp;nbsp; Haven&#039;t scheduled hair or any of that.&amp;nbsp; I was under the assumption you do that when you get down. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1340351,"PostDate":1289867419,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I personally didn't think you picked your restaurant until you got there.\u00a0 i'm using the cake and flowers from the resort too.\u00a0 So all I have gone is booked the vacation, paid, emailed the wedding planner the package we want and booked the date.\u00a0 Thats it.\u00a0 Haven't scheduled hair or any of that.\u00a0 I was under the assumption you do that when you get down. \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Gran Bahia Principe - Runaway Bay - February 22, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"akua420@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1270637423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akua420","Id":227119,"Name":"akua420","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"290e4b8da05147a68030bd31498f4301","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; akua420- I am in the same boat! Picking everything when I get there... everything will be irie!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1340548,"PostDate":1289881716,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> akua420- I am in the same boat! Picking everything when I get there... everything will be irie!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennyslack@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1262229008,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224208.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennypenny23","Id":224208,"Name":"jennypenny23","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5564,"TotalPages":557,"CurrentPage":430,"NextPage":440,"PreviousPage":420,"LastPage":5560},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
