{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"15cfe037c37b8bdbdfc3ddd512b2b770","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;ve been emailing her assistant directly from the beginning and i get reply&#039;s within a day or two everytime. i think this is the easiest way to go :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1342115,"PostDate":1290025187,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I've been emailing her assistant directly from the beginning and i get reply's within a day or two everytime. i think this is the easiest way to go <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"c_bass47@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1288080622,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233494.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cassierose","Id":233494,"Name":"Cassierose","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b97ee3e78937247f8322a46fd966a775","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]TMwedding2011[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n i am from atlantic canada and we booked with air transat in October and we were not offered any free wedding. I would also like to know how people got this. I am thinking that it was offered last year and this summer and they must have discontinued this ?![\/quote] \n \n \n  iam getting my ta to look into the free wedding, we have 22 going and the pkg through transat is alot of $ and is the same as free wedding they offer.very frustrating","Attachments":[],"Id":1342190,"PostDate":1290030229,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>TMwedding2011<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> i am from atlantic canada and we booked with air transat in October and we were not offered any free wedding. I would also like to know how people got this. I am thinking that it was offered last year and this summer and they must have discontinued this ?!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0iam getting my ta to look into the free wedding, we have 22 going and the pkg through transat is alot of $ and is the same as free wedding they offer.very frustrating<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tmmartell@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1284229239,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232240.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TMwedding2011","Id":232240,"Name":"TMwedding2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6a9776ac2ac8da0555bebca5bb1b6d7e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; The free wedding still exists as I talked to Beverly about a month ago for my May wedding...it works out to be WAY cheaper that way too. We have 42 people right now and its still cheaper to pay the $25 per person for the dinner, minister fees, gazebo rental etc was like $1700.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The free wedding was included in the packages she sent me the day we booked with our TA&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1342283,"PostDate":1290036560,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> The free wedding still exists as I talked to Beverly about a month ago for my May wedding...it works out to be WAY cheaper that way too. We have 42 people right now and its still cheaper to pay the $25 per person for the dinner, minister fees, gazebo rental etc was like $1700.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The free wedding was included in the packages she sent me the day we booked with our TA<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Today I marry my bestfriend, the one I laugh with, the one I love.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kfairful@alumni.uoguelph.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1272162450,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227617.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katelynn","Id":227617,"Name":"katelynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eeacd64d8e29fa3c356e6e3c3d504e22","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; From what I&amp;nbsp;understood from&amp;nbsp;my TA , is that she books the trip but doesn&#039;t deal with the wedding stuff. She only gave me an email address. When&amp;nbsp;I contacted Beverly she said: book your wedding and then&amp;nbsp;book your rooms and then send me the form. I don&#039;t think it matters with who (nolitours, sunwigs, transat, on Internet&amp;nbsp;etc.) you book with because ultimately it&#039;s the resort that charges and takes care of the wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1342322,"PostDate":1290039117,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> From what I\u00a0understood from\u00a0my TA , is that she books the trip but doesn't deal with the wedding stuff. She only gave me an email address. When\u00a0I contacted Beverly she said: book your wedding and then\u00a0book your rooms and then send me the form. I don't think it matters with who (nolitours, sunwigs, transat, on Internet\u00a0etc.) you book with because ultimately it's the resort that charges and takes care of the wedding.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stefanichayer@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1287873579,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233439.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":149,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"schayer","Id":233439,"Name":"schayer","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"181793e42f23381d814f48ee271c0479","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Ya my TA said she doesn&#039;t want to get into the wedding stuff, which is understadable and she gave me the email info and that&#039;s it.&amp;nbsp; I will wait to see what Beverly or her assistant say about the free wedding package as we don&#039;t need much.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Katelynn - Did she say how much the gazebo rental and the minister fees are with the free wedding package?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1342327,"PostDate":1290040204,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Ya my TA said she doesn't want to get into the wedding stuff, which is understadable and she gave me the email info and that's it.\u00a0 I will wait to see what Beverly or her assistant say about the free wedding package as we don't need much.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Katelynn - Did she say how much the gazebo rental and the minister fees are with the free wedding package?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keristonge@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1289945054,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233998.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"keriltz","Id":233998,"Name":"keriltz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c317a81820e380cce9938c4b29d124f5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Anybody have any pics of the private room for weddings or know what the room is like ?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1342373,"PostDate":1290045292,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Anybody have any pics of the private room for weddings or know what the room is like ?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dglobush@mts.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1272527974,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227741.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DeeG","Id":227741,"Name":"DeeG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7e6b0571b23d187809a18f14f333af7d","RawContent":"thank you sooo much for posting this. I never ever would have realized it still existed if it wasn&#039;t for you and a few others posting and would have paid hundreds of dollars more through air transat for  the wedding. My TA is fantastic and is doing all of the planning. :) thanks again !\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]katelynn[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n The free wedding still exists as I talked to Beverly about a month ago for my May wedding...it works out to be WAY cheaper that way too. We have 42 people right now and its still cheaper to pay the $25 per person for the dinner, minister fees, gazebo rental etc was like $1700. \n \n The free wedding was included in the packages she sent me the day we booked with our TA[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1342927,"PostDate":1290107788,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> thank you sooo much for posting this. I never ever would have realized it still existed if it wasn't for you and a few others posting and would have paid hundreds of dollars more through air transat for\u00a0 the wedding. My TA is fantastic and is doing all of the planning. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> thanks again !<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>katelynn<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> The free wedding still exists as I talked to Beverly about a month ago for my May wedding...it works out to be WAY cheaper that way too. We have 42 people right now and its still cheaper to pay the $25 per person for the dinner, minister fees, gazebo rental etc was like $1700.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The free wedding was included in the packages she sent me the day we booked with our TA<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tmmartell@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1284229239,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232240.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TMwedding2011","Id":232240,"Name":"TMwedding2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"87bcf73ff7b12abdae25701f2c20ee99","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; When I asked Beverly she told me that it was no more, and I couldn&#039;t get it either and I booked in April.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m getting married Feb 22.&amp;nbsp; So thats crazy if you can and I was wrongly informed.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1342957,"PostDate":1290109143,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> When I asked Beverly she told me that it was no more, and I couldn't get it either and I booked in April.\u00a0 I'm getting married Feb 22.\u00a0 So thats crazy if you can and I was wrongly informed.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Gran Bahia Principe - Runaway Bay - February 22, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"akua420@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1270637423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akua420","Id":227119,"Name":"akua420","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"06034d8b505ff071f8cb923dcda439b6","RawContent":"You should check with her again when you get there...  Maybe they stopped offering it for a while, then started again?  Not sure, but when my TA gave me the forms to fill out and book the date, she had a print off of the free wedding package that I was able to select too...and that was only 2 months ago?  IDK, maybe it&#039;s just if you book through a TA they can get the deal for you???  Good luck, I hope you can figure it out...\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]akua420[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n When I asked Beverly she told me that it was no more, and I couldn&#039;t get it either and I booked in April.  I&#039;m getting married Feb 22.  So thats crazy if you can and I was wrongly informed.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1343077,"PostDate":1290118264,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> You should check with her again when you get there...\u00a0 Maybe they stopped offering it for a while, then started again?\u00a0 Not sure, but when my TA gave me the forms to fill out and book the date, she had a print off of the free wedding package that I was able to select too...and that was only 2 months ago?\u00a0 IDK, maybe it's just if you book through a TA they can get the deal for you???\u00a0 Good luck, I hope you can figure it out...<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>akua420<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid ;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> When I asked Beverly she told me that it was no more, and I couldn't get it either and I booked in April.\u00a0 I'm getting married Feb 22.\u00a0 So thats crazy if you can and I was wrongly informed.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Gran Bahia Principe ~ Runaway Bay, Jamaica ~ November 11th, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jenniferpeterman@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1289246288,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233805.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jenandmark","Id":233805,"Name":"jenandmark","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7c693e77d8b425ffecfeab4a8451bacb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I just got an email back and Beverly&#039;s assitant said i am eligable for the free package and she sent be the info.&amp;nbsp; I was going to do the cheapest one anyways which was $700 + $35 per person after 16 and the free package i say the $700 right off the bat and also it&#039;s only $25 per person after the 16.&amp;nbsp; All i have to pay for is the extra people and the flowers.&amp;nbsp; Also are you ladies using the hotel photographer that is supplied or are you getting a different one?&amp;nbsp; I heard people say they have bargin&#039;d with the photographer and got the entire disk of pictures for $300 so i&#039;m hoping to do the same.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1343094,"PostDate":1290119238,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I just got an email back and Beverly's assitant said i am eligable for the free package and she sent be the info.\u00a0 I was going to do the cheapest one anyways which was $700 + $35 per person after 16 and the free package i say the $700 right off the bat and also it's only $25 per person after the 16.\u00a0 All i have to pay for is the extra people and the flowers.\u00a0 Also are you ladies using the hotel photographer that is supplied or are you getting a different one?\u00a0 I heard people say they have bargin'd with the photographer and got the entire disk of pictures for $300 so i'm hoping to do the same.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keristonge@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1289945054,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233998.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"keriltz","Id":233998,"Name":"keriltz","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5564,"TotalPages":557,"CurrentPage":450,"NextPage":460,"PreviousPage":440,"LastPage":5560},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
