neheight\"><span>Today I marry my bestfriend, the one I laugh with, the one I love.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kfairful@alumni.uoguelph.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1272162450,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227617.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katelynn","Id":227617,"Name":"katelynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f84315a4d567f3acb68b02ecfbe5e148","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I was told for chairs they all have white chair covers and they include the chair covers for the amount of people included in your package and also for each additional person you pay for.&amp;nbsp; You will have to pay extra for the sashes if you want them&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Katelynn - Thanks for the info on Jan&#039;s Flowers! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1344005,"PostDate":1290211769,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I was told for chairs they all have white chair covers and they include the chair covers for the amount of people included in your package and also for each additional person you pay for.\u00a0 You will have to pay extra for the sashes if you want them<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Katelynn - Thanks for the info on Jan's Flowers! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keristonge@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1289945054,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233998.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"keriltz","Id":233998,"Name":"keriltz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"681fc746ab693b31661cfebe2ed705b9","RawContent":"Akua oh no I can&#039;t believe the salon is booked. Who would have thought?!?! Is there anyway you can send me the salon contact info? I&#039;m going to try and see if there are any appointments still available for when I&#039;m down. I can&#039;t do hair either!","Attachments":[],"Id":1344595,"PostDate":1290354759,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Akua oh no I can't believe the salon is booked. Who would have thought?!?! Is there anyway you can send me the salon contact info? I'm going to try and see if there are any appointments still available for when I'm down. I can't do hair either!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Getting married in Runaway Bay, Jamaica February 2011!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyl_84@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1271190989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227291.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AshleyL","Id":227291,"Name":"AshleyL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5a93b40c2262ea4dac3538da709792ee","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]AshleyL[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n  Is there anyway you can send me the salon contact info? I&#039;m going to try and see if there are any appointments still available for when I&#039;m down. I can&#039;t do hair either![\/quote] \n \n \n  Hi Ashley here is the spas email spabpjam@bahia-principe.com \n \n I&#039;m kind of worried now too because I&#039;m getting married in January and am only about to contact them now to book an apppointment...heres hoping! lol \n \n Also just an fyi ladies: \n For some reason I wanted to make sure I could put the wedding on my credit card because I don&#039;t want to bring down all of that cash with me so I double checked with Beverly and she said you can BUT the ministers fees have to be paid in cash so I just thought I&#039;d let you all know just incase you were planning on doing the same thing I was! It would have really sucked to get down there and have to scramble around to get the money together or give it to them out of my spending money! \n \n Only 50 days until my wedding! I&#039;m so excited but still have quite a bit to do!","Attachments":[],"Id":1345072,"PostDate":1290404629,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>AshleyL<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> \u00a0Is there anyway you can send me the salon contact info? I'm going to try and see if there are any appointments still available for when I'm down. I can't do hair either!<\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0Hi Ashley here is the spas email spabpjam@bahia-principe.com<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm kind of worried now too because I'm getting married in January and am only about to contact them now to book an apppointment...heres hoping! lol<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also just an fyi ladies:<\/p> <p> For some reason I wanted to make sure I could put the wedding on my credit card because I don't want to bring down all of that cash with me so I double checked with Beverly and she said you can BUT\u00a0the ministers fees\u00a0have to be paid in cash so I just thought I'd let you all know just incase you were planning on doing the same thing I was! It would have really sucked to get down there and have to scramble around to get the money together or give it to them out of my spending money!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Only 50 days until my wedding! I'm so excited but still have quite a bit to do!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;46;23\/st\/20110111\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/16e1\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...16e1\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sara.willy@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1259221185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223542.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"soontobemrsdow","Id":223542,"Name":"soontobemrsdow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"176ff94ae69bf52c6dcc633c02fa5750","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I notice alot of Brides saying they still have a ton of things to do, what is it that all needs to be done!?&amp;nbsp; I don&#039;t feel like i really have anything to do and haven&#039;t really done anything so far.&amp;nbsp; I hope i&#039;m not missing a ton of things to do and get down there and realize i didn&#039;t do anything right!&amp;nbsp; Help anyone?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have already:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; - Ordered my dress&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; - Got bridesmaid dresses&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; - Picked Flowers&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; - Got wedding favors for guests&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; - Got rings&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; - Booked the trip with the TA&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; - Scheduled the JP to come to our house to legally marry us (we aren&#039;t legally getting married in Jamaica)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I thought that would be everything?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1345258,"PostDate":1290449932,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I notice alot of Brides saying they still have a ton of things to do, what is it that all needs to be done!?\u00a0 I don't feel like i really have anything to do and haven't really done anything so far.\u00a0 I hope i'm not missing a ton of things to do and get down there and realize i didn't do anything right!\u00a0 Help anyone?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have already:<\/p> <p> - Ordered my dress<\/p> <p> - Got bridesmaid dresses<\/p> <p> - Picked Flowers<\/p> <p> - Got wedding favors for guests<\/p> <p> - Got rings<\/p> <p> - Booked the trip with the TA<\/p> <p> - Scheduled the JP to come to our house to legally marry us (we aren't legally getting married in Jamaica)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I thought that would be everything?\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keristonge@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1289945054,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233998.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"keriltz","Id":233998,"Name":"keriltz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"af7ea7a8b23257a5fc0d08832f7c0c8b","RawContent":"Thanks for the heads up!  [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif[\/img]\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]soontobemrsdow[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n \n   \n Quote: \n Originally Posted by [b]AshleyL[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n  Is there anyway you can send me the salon contact info? I&#039;m going to try and see if there are any appointments still available for when I&#039;m down. I can&#039;t do hair either![\/quote] \n \n \n  Hi Ashley here is the spas email spabpjam@bahia-principe.com \n \n I&#039;m kind of worried now too because I&#039;m getting married in January and am only about to contact them now to book an apppointment...heres hoping! lol \n \n Also just an fyi ladies: \n For some reason I wanted to make sure I could put the wedding on my credit card because I don&#039;t want to bring down all of that cash with me so I double checked with Beverly and she said you can BUT the ministers fees have to be paid in cash so I just thought I&#039;d let you all know just incase you were planning on doing the same thing I was! It would have really sucked to get down there and have to scramble around to get the money together or give it to them out of my spending money! \n \n Only 50 days until my wedding! I&#039;m so excited but still have quite a bit to do!","Attachments":[{"Id":12179,"Name":"LinenSuitSwatchReal.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2010\/post-29134-138462465716.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2010\/post-29134-138462465716_thumb.jpg","Width":490,"Height":650}],"Id":1345306,"PostDate":1290452916,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks for the heads up!\u00a0 <span alt=\":D\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" \/><\/span><\/span><br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>soontobemrsdow<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid ;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <div class=\"quote-container\"> <span>Quote:<\/span> <div class=\"quote-block\"> Originally Posted by <strong>AshleyL<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid ;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> \u00a0Is there anyway you can send me the salon contact info? I'm going to try and see if there are any appointments still available for when I'm down. I can't do hair either!<\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0Hi Ashley here is the spas email spabpjam@bahia-principe.com<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm kind of worried now too because I'm getting married in January and am only about to contact them now to book an apppointment...heres hoping! lol<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also just an fyi ladies:<\/p> <p> For some reason I wanted to make sure I could put the wedding on my credit card because I don't want to bring down all of that cash with me so I double checked with Beverly and she said you can BUT\u00a0the ministers fees\u00a0have to be paid in cash so I just thought I'd let you all know just incase you were planning on doing the same thing I was! It would have really sucked to get down there and have to scramble around to get the money together or give it to them out of my spending money!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Only 50 days until my wedding! I'm so excited but still have quite a bit to do!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Gran Bahia Principe ~ Runaway Bay, Jamaica ~ November 11th, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jenniferpeterman@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1289246288,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233805.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jenandmark","Id":233805,"Name":"jenandmark","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fd9f5eca5cddba8078ffe0b6f5ac7187","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Keriltz - I think you got lots done!&amp;nbsp; It all depends on how many details you want taken care of before you go down....&amp;nbsp; You have all the big things taken care of, so don&#039;t worry!&amp;nbsp; Here&#039;s my &amp;quot;Done&amp;quot; and &amp;quot;To Do&amp;quot; lists:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Done:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; booked and paid for our trip tp Jamaica&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; confirmed wedding date and time with Beverly&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; sent our invites&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; ordered dress&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; bought&amp;nbsp;FI&#039;s suit&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; bought bridesmaids&#039; dresses&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; bought GMs&#039; outfits&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; ordered real touch bouquets&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; bought flowergirl pomander and ring bearer dish&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; bought bridesmaid gifts&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; booked photographer and paid for her trip&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; booked hair appointment at resort&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; booked gazebo and DJ for the reception with Beverly&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; bought wedding jewelry, shoes and hair flower&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; To Do:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; order travel mugs once we have final numbers (we aren&#039;t doing OOT bags - just mugs)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; buy GM, flowergirl and ring bearer gifts&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; buy wedding bands - we have them picked out&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; order sand ceremony frame&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; get dress alterations done&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; create playlist for the reception&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1345391,"PostDate":1290459897,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Keriltz - I think you got lots done!\u00a0 It all depends on how many details you want taken care of before you go down....\u00a0 You have all the big things taken care of, so don't worry!\u00a0 Here's my \"Done\" and \"To Do\" lists:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Done:<\/p> <p> booked and paid for our trip tp Jamaica<\/p> <p> confirmed wedding date and time with Beverly<\/p> <p> sent our invites<\/p> <p> ordered dress<\/p> <p> bought\u00a0FI's suit<\/p> <p> bought bridesmaids' dresses<\/p> <p> bought GMs' outfits<\/p> <p> ordered real touch bouquets<\/p> <p> bought flowergirl pomander and ring bearer dish<\/p> <p> bought bridesmaid gifts<\/p> <p> booked photographer and paid for her trip<\/p> <p> booked hair appointment at resort<\/p> <p> booked gazebo and DJ for the reception with Beverly<\/p> <p> bought wedding jewelry, shoes and hair flower<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> To Do:<\/p> <p> order travel mugs once we have final numbers (we aren't doing OOT bags - just mugs)<\/p> <p> buy GM, flowergirl and ring bearer gifts<\/p> <p> buy wedding bands - we have them picked out<\/p> <p> order sand ceremony frame<\/p> <p> get dress alterations done<\/p> <p> create playlist for the reception<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leahsmith21@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1276048572,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228989.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lsmith211","Id":228989,"Name":"lsmith211","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5ebf086cf1ddd48754b7eb3e9f730095","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey Everyone....happy Monday! lol&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; A heads up for things that have helped me:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; There is a thread where Brides on here have posted their entire playlist...I am weeding through it now.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/thread\/42149\/anyone-have-their-entire-playlist\/130\"&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/thread\/42149\/anyone-have-their-entire-playlist\/130&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I bought my sand ceremony frame from the Umbra website and they delivered it to my house in like 2 days...I think it was $40. However, you can buy from Amazon if you live in the USA and I have recently seen them at Chapters!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We got our mugs from 4imprint.ca and they are AMAZING! and sooo easy and nice to work with, further they are reasonably priced and they still send us samples in the mail like every month of cool stuff!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We got our rings from Mappins. If you sign up online you get a $50 coupon and if you sign up in store for their CC you get an extra 10% off...so Mike and I each did this and our rings together were like $800...a steal if you ask me!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; What I still have to do:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am looking for some nice cards to give my mom, FMIL and grandma the day of the wedding and im going to write a poem inside but have not found any I like...if any of you girls have any suggestions it would be sooo helpful! I have also bought them hankies and thought I would make them an album after the wedding.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also - what are you girls getting your FI on the wedding day....I am so confused with this!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1345428,"PostDate":1290462701,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Everyone....happy Monday! lol<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> A heads up for things that have helped me:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> There is a thread where Brides on here have posted their entire playlist...I am weeding through it now.<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/thread\/42149\/anyone-have-their-entire-playlist\/130' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...re-playlist\/130<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I bought my sand ceremony frame from the Umbra website and they delivered it to my house in like 2 days...I think it was $40. However, you can buy from Amazon if you live in the USA and I have recently seen them at Chapters!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We got our mugs from 4imprint.ca and they are AMAZING! and sooo easy and nice to work with, further they are reasonably priced and they still send us samples in the mail like every month of cool stuff!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We got our rings from Mappins. If you sign up online you get a $50 coupon and if you sign up in store for their CC you get an extra 10% off...so Mike and I each did this and our rings together were like $800...a steal if you ask me!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> What I still have to do:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am looking for some nice cards to give my mom, FMIL and grandma the day of the wedding and im going to write a poem inside but have not found any I like...if any of you girls have any suggestions it would be sooo helpful! I have also bought them hankies and thought I would make them an album after the wedding.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also - what are you girls getting your FI on the wedding day....I am so confused with this!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Today I marry my bestfriend, the one I laugh with, the one I love.<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kfairful@alumni.uoguelph.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1272162450,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227617.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katelynn","Id":227617,"Name":"katelynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2c3dbb625db278f2a7f0d835fa7edb36","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks Katelynn - very helpful!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1345492,"PostDate":1290467794,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks Katelynn - very helpful!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leahsmith21@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1276048572,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228989.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lsmith211","Id":228989,"Name":"lsmith211","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44634,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"93d408b466f91ab82de278bdc921698b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I think my FI is just going to rent a suit\/tux before we go. As for the GM i told them what i would like them to wear so hopefully that&#039;s what they get.&amp;nbsp;Haha&amp;nbsp; I don&#039;t&amp;nbsp; really want to do anything extravagent to i think i&#039;m done!&amp;nbsp; I hope!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I would also like to get my FI something for the wedding day but i also have no idea what to get him!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1345520,"PostDate":1290469871,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I think my FI is just going to rent a suit\/tux before we go. As for the GM i told them what i would like them to wear so hopefully that's what they get.\u00a0Haha\u00a0 I don't\u00a0 really want to do anything extravagent to i think i'm done!\u00a0 I hope!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I would also like to get my FI something for the wedding day but i also have no idea what to get him!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keristonge@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1289945054,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233998.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"keriltz","Id":233998,"Name":"keriltz","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"44634","Title":"Any Gran Bahia Principe Runaway Bay Brides out there?","LastPostDate":1467934433},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5564,"TotalPages":557,"CurrentPage":470,"NextPage":480,"PreviousPage":460,"LastPage":5560},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
